flowchart TD
    HTML[Hosted HTML JavaScript] --> Facade[window.slop_boutique]
    Eval[Browser agent eval] --> Facade
    Facade --> RPC[Authenticated view RPC]
    Model[Any hosted model call] --> Tools[Reserved server catalog tools]
    RPC --> Auth[Current principal and membership checks]
    Tools --> Auth
    Auth --> Read[Shared catalog read service]
    Read --> Published[Published public projections]
    Read --> Policy[Current download entitlement]
    Policy --> Source[Bounded source text]
